pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: nav-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: nav-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 0, 400, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$white"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>05 应对这些挑战的方法/策略</p>
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 55, 900, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>策略四：强 Process Attribution</strong></p>
  - elementId: intro
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 110, 1160, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>Context binding 需要同时满足四个条件，才能把一个 event 标为"强证据"：</p>
  - elementId: condition-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [60, 160, 1160, 250]
    columnWidths: [0.1, 0.4, 0.25, 0.25]
    rowHeights: [0.15, 0.17, 0.17, 0.17, 0.17, 0.17]
    style: "$default"
    rows:
      - - content: {text: "#"}
        - content: {text: "条件"}
        - content: {text: "检查内容"}
        - content: {text: "失败处理"}
      - - content: {text: "1"}
        - content: {text: "Trace window 的 marker scope 有效"}
        - content: {text: "accepted_window gate 通过"}
        - content: {text: "不进入 claim"}
      - - content: {text: "2"}
        - content: {text: "Runtime process map 状态为 PASS"}
        - content: {text: "/proc/pid/maps 完整匹配"}
        - content: {text: "降级或 block"}
      - - content: {text: "3"}
        - content: {text: "Event PC 落在 target child 的 runtime map 中"}
        - content: {text: "PC 属于目标进程"}
        - content: {text: "降级或 block"}
      - - content: {text: "4"}
        - content: {text: "Event PC 能匹配 target code map site"}
        - content: {text: "静态 ELF 范围匹配"}
        - content: {text: "降级或 block"}
      - - content: {text: "结果"}
        - content: {text: "所有 4 个条件同时满足"}
        - content: {text: "强证据标签"}
        - content: {text: "reportable claim"}
  - elementId: bottom-note-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 430, 1160, 80]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#EFF6FF"
  - elementId: bottom-note-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 440, 1120, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>对于 PIE/ASLR/dynamic libs/fork/exec 链，如果缺少 runtime evidence，<strong>不强行 claim</strong>，而是 downgrade 或 block。降级后的字段仍保留在 artifact 中，但标签变为 validation_oracle 或 lower-confidence。</p>
  - elementId: challenge-map
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 530, 1160, 100]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>Challenge → Mechanism → Artifact 对照</strong>：</p>
        <p>低语义 raw trace → ELF + Runtime context binding → semantic_events.json + 数据溯源标签</p>
        <p>Pointer 过度声称 → Bounded ARG_MEM prefix + 约束s → hardware_pointer_prefix_summary.json</p>
        <p>Oracle 污染 → Provenance filter (4-class labels) → validation_oracle 字段不进入 report</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 680, 400, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>RV-MalTrace 深度技术汇报</p>
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1180, 680, 60, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>26</p>
